tloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Lion Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Trophy_336d38.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Wolf Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wolf_Trophy_8a9152.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sniper%20Gloves\"><img alt=\"Sniper Gloves\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sniper_Gloves_3273da.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map tyrsung\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"172\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_tyrsung_bf2a10.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Tyrsung</b> is a small island to the south-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Hrodmir\">Hrodmir</a>. An ice shield is covering the mountain of Tyrsung. Tyrsung and <a href=\"#/wiki/Okolnir\">Okolnir</a> broke apart from the main island because of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Trench\">deep ocean trench</a> where two oceanic crusts diverge. There have been reports of frost giants inhabitating the ice shield. Far to the south of the island it has been said that furriers have settled in there and are posing a rather worrying threat to the seals and other local fauna. Note that this page does not cover the Frost Giants' mountain, <a href=\"#/wiki/Jotunar\">Jotunar</a>, in the middle of the island.\n</p><p>The Mountain in the center of the island is a great place for players between level 40 and 60 to hunt. With bonus you can make about 55k/hour. See <a href=\"#/wiki/Jotunar\">Jotunar</a> for more information.\n</p><p>At the top of the mountain is also the portal to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Court%20of%20Winter\">Court of Winter</a>.\n</p><p><b>Note: In order to travel to Tyrsung from NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a>, it is necessary, in addition to <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-test-quest\">Barbarian Test Quest</a>, to have at least started the mission \"Nibelor 2: Ecological Terrorism\" of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>.</b>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Tyrsung NPCs (3 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Baltim\">Baltim</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Baltim\"><img alt=\"Baltim\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Baltim_93f957.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Representative</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">South part of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tyrsung</strong>, north-west building (one floor up) in the village full of <a href=\"#/wiki/Smuggler\">Smugglers</a>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\">Buddel</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Buddel\"><img alt=\"Buddel\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Buddel_b81d7d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ferryman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">South of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a>, <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tyrsung</strong> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32332,31230,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32332, 31230, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Okolnir\">Okolnir</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32224,31382,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32224, 31382, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Settlements\">Barbarian Settlements</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32020,31294,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32020, 31294, 7)</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Helheim\">Helheim</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32465,31174,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32465, 31174, 7)</a>).</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zora\">Zora</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Zora\"><img alt=\"Zora\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zora_dd10c1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Equipment Shopkeeper</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\">South part of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tyrsung</strong>, north building (one floor up) in the village full of <a href=\"#/wiki/Smuggler\">Smugglers</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters on Surface</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Penguin\"><img alt=\"Penguin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Penguin_ce9a0c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Penguin\">Penguin</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">33</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">3 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\"